                            <div class="dics-section-heading">
                                <div>
                                    <span class="dics-eyebrow">Module Capabilities</span>
                                    <h2>Engineered Odoo Architecture</h2>
                                </div>
                                <p>Every module is tailored to align with your exact operational rules, custom approval limits, and reporting requirements.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="dics-module-grid">
                                <div class="dics-module-card dics-module-card-accent">
                                    <div class="dics-module-icon"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">warehouse</span></div>
                                    <h3>Advanced WMS &amp; Storage</h3>
